00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.710
SPEAKER: Securing
modern web applications

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:10.070
can be a challenge with an
escalating number of threats,

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:13.070
having to manage multiple
vendors and point products,

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.710
and an increasingly high
standard of security

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.910
expected by your customers.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.060
Google Cloud
simplifies all of that

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.070
by giving you
comprehensive protection

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:24.620
through a suite of
proven Google technology,

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.290
all managed from a
single interface.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:30.170
Protecting some of the most
prolific internet properties--

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:33.020
such as Google Search,
Gmail, and YouTube--

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:36.050
has led Google to develop
advanced and sophisticated

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.720
protections which you can
now leverage for your web

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.940
applications and APIs.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.330
Implement an industry-standard
web application firewall

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:47.360
with granular IP and
geo-based controls

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.580
and defend against
prevalent attacks

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:53.600
such as denial of service,
cross-site scripting, and SQL

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.800
injection.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.340
Protect your web app from
fraudulent activity and abuse.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.520
With Google Cloud, you have
access to intelligent fraud

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.560
and bot detection services.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.780
With an adaptive
risk analysis engine

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:08.930
assessing the needs of your
business and rich telemetry,

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:12.290
you can easily protect from
scraping, credential stuffing,

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:16.340
automated account creation, and
exploits from automated bots.

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:19.220
Integrations can be
another point of weakness.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:23.390
With Google Cloud, you can
secure your APIs in minutes.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:27.410
Out-of-the-box policies enable
developers to augment APIs with

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:30.350
features to control traffic,
enhance performance,

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:34.300
and enforce security.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:37.570
Meet the challenge of securing
modern web applications

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:41.800
with Google Cloud's Web
App and API Protection.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:45.010
If you want to learn more about
this solution, watch a webinar,

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:49.620
